        "heading": "Strength Starts With Your Feet",
        "body": "<p>Healthy movement begins at the foundation of your body—<strong>your feet</strong>. When your feet can move naturally, the muscles responsible for <strong>balance, posture,</strong> and <strong>stability</strong> become stronger and more active, helping reduce tension, discomfort, and fatigue throughout your legs and lower body.</p><p>Hike's natural-motion footwear is designed to encourage proper foot function, allowing your body to <strong>realign, build resilience,</strong> and <strong>support</strong> itself with every step. Over time, this leads to better mobility, fewer common foot problems, and improved overall well-being.</p><p>Step into footwear that <strong>restores</strong> how your body was meant to move!</p>",
